  "scope": "Faster RTX 5090 decode: the container moves to runtime 9d1ef748, whose MTP3 verify pass runs its four Q5 projections at the four-token extent on a small-T tensor-core MMA instead of the SIMT row kernels. Release build against release build, the MTP3 round is 3.5-4.9% shorter and decode +4.4% at a 26K context, +3.6% at 60K and +6.3% at 1,024 tokens. The accumulation order changes, so generated text differs from v0.8.2's on 58 of 89 role-corpus cases; a pre-registered paired screen of 504 redaction prompts found the route's redaction behaviour not worse than production's (docs/measurements/2026-09-27-powered-redaction-screen.json, EXP-063). The serving arguments, deployment profile qwen38-5090-v0.8.2 and configuration 56878aed are v0.8.2's. The RTX 4090 native package 5a774841, the upstream OMP 18.3.0 client, the model and the memory floors are unchanged. RTX 3090 is omitted pending physical-host access. Every RTX 5090 gate below was measured on the published image; the RTX 4090 gates are v0.8.1's for the same package.",
